 번호로 연락주시기 바랍니다. </font></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.8; word-break: break-all; text-align: center;\"><font color=\"#ff0000\"><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">* 문의 : 054-478-7223</span></font></p></pre><p style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; text-wrap: wrap; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all; text-align: center;\"><br></p><pre style=\"font-family: SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace; font-size: 12.25px; overflow: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; line-height: 1.625rem; word-break: keep-all;\"><pre style=\"font-family: SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace; font-size: 10.7188px; overflow: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; line-height: 1.625rem; word-break: keep-all;\"><pre style=\"font-family: SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace; font-size: 10px; overflow: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; line-height: 1.625rem; word-break: keep-all;\"><p style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; text-wrap: wrap; line-height: 2; word-break: break-all; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(70, 115, 255); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">붙임 1.</span> 2023-2024 쿠웨이트 정부초청 어학연수 장학생 선발요강</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; line-height: 2; word-break: break-all; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; text-wrap: wrap;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); background-color: rgb(70, 115, 255);\">붙임 2. </span></span><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, H